{"name": "Mystery Box: Hidden Secrets", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras_big/c0994765a6b59cd0eeaa6b1402eecbb5.avif?t=1785487189\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/c0994765a6b59cd0eeaa6b1402eecbb5.avif?t=1785487189\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To unlock the boxes of this escape room game, you have to interact with objects, handles, buttons, and wheels on each side. You can find puzzle pieces on the side of the boxes as well. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras_big/2315bdb9c4600409f891809996aaef35.avif?t=1785487189\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/2315bdb9c4600409f891809996aaef35.avif?t=1785487189\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The illusion of holding a real object in total darkness is compelling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras_big/9967d65853ff1be3bd2258764777cf53.avif?t=1785487189\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/9967d65853ff1be3bd2258764777cf53.avif?t=1785487189\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you open all 8 boxes of a Level Pack, you can compose a puzzle and find a brief history of the discovered invention</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras_big/6915559d841fd7e4725afa08ae02e634.avif?t=1785487189\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/6915559d841fd7e4725afa08ae02e634.avif?t=1785487189\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think outside of the box to solve all enigmas, it's not always an easy job to escape the rooms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras_big/a0bb3bc9645484dbc99805803640b208.avif?t=1785487189\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/a0bb3bc9645484dbc99805803640b208.avif?t=1785487189\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the game with your headphones on to get immersed in this amazing adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras_big/9998a5909b2c7ce1f4a3e2db158b17ea.avif?t=1785487189\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/9998a5909b2c7ce1f4a3e2db158b17ea.avif?t=1785487189\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tap the bulb button to get a helpful hint and unlock the boxes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras_big/a2f9707f7f1855beebdede83a6ee0896.avif?t=1785487189\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/a2f9707f7f1855beebdede83a6ee0896.avif?t=1785487189\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Solve intricate 3D-style box puzzles in Mystery Box: Hidden Secrets\u2014a 2D point-and-click escape game. Examine mechanical boxes, crack complex logic riddles, find hidden puzzle tiles, and unveil fascinating stories of historic inventions", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/806ab38f576ad2f9a57fe57083d22203d9616ebd/header.jpg?t=1785487189", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Puzzle", "Strategy", "Exploration", "Hidden Object", "Atmospheric", "Mystery"], "developers": "XSGames", "publishers": "XSGames", "release_date": "Aug 12, 2023", "price": "$4.99", "appid": "1735790", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "8 May 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/_DlX7JlLjYo", "first_seen": 1746662400.0, "review_rank": 1688}